## Local development containers

Generation wrote the container controls and started nothing: `renvor docker up` is the command
that does. `compose.yaml` runs the services `renvor.toml` records, with every published port bound
to `127.0.0.1`. See `.env.example` for the two container passwords.
{% endif %}

## What this is not

A deployment. Secrets come from a file here and from a secret manager there; TLS to the backends
is off for loopback and on by default anywhere else; the limitations above are real. Renvor's
own limitations ledger says what it does not yet do, and this project inherits every line of it.
